WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.710
Film Courage: I would imagine Bill that you
get emails everyday from people asking for

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.010
career advice.

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:12.580
Can you tell from some of the emails those
who really want help and those you may not

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.129
be able to help?

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:27.529
Bill Duke, actor, director, producer, author:
Yes.

00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:43.810
There are people who 
somehow they think something is going to be

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:53.520
given to them 
and there are other people who they talk to

00:00:53.520 --> 00:01:02.900
you for guidance about how they can get it
themselves.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:12.229
The people who ask for guidance of how they
can get it for themselves, I’m interested

00:01:12.229 --> 00:01:16.659
in them because they are not asking me to
do it for them.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:25.020
They’re saying “You have experience and
I’m willing to listen to you so I don’t

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:38.689
make crazy mistakes" and so those people I
relate to because somebody did that for me.

00:01:38.689 --> 00:01:47.909
People who come out and they just want as
you so eloquently spoke before notoriety they’re

00:01:47.909 --> 00:01:52.560
not serious about this industry, not serious
about being a great actor or a great writer,

00:01:52.560 --> 00:02:01.509
great producer, great director they just want
to be seen and have people know who they are.

00:02:01.509 --> 00:02:03.969
I don’t take them seriously.

00:02:03.969 --> 00:02:13.560
I have a foundation called Duke Media Foundation
we teach kids media literacy which what are

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.500
the jobs of the future going to be and financial
literacy.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:26.640
If you make money, not just spend it, how
do you use it?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:33.450
Plus the young kids that are serious if we
can get an opportunity to help them, we do.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:40.680
I think there is validity in coming out here
with dreams and wanted just to be recognized

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:49.069
or notoriety but it’s not a serious craft
of industry, it’s just some insecurities

00:02:49.069 --> 00:02:51.599
that you have that you want to overcome.

00:02:51.599 --> 00:02:57.470
Film Courage: So when you receive an email
how can you tell the ones that really are

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:04.829
looking to find ways so they can then do it
themselves and those who want just a hand

00:03:04.829 --> 00:03:05.829
up?

00:03:05.829 --> 00:03:08.379
Bill: They say it.

00:03:08.379 --> 00:03:10.950
They’re very clear.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:17.260
There are some people who are so unaware of
how this place works.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:21.859
They’ll say “Oh I want an agent and I
know you have an agent.

00:03:21.859 --> 00:03:26.850
Can’t you just introduce me to your agent?”

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.900
And I’m saying “Do you have any pictures?”

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.640
“No I don’t have any pictures?”

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.879
“Do you have a reel?”

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:37.060
“No I don’t have a reel.”

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.639
“Have you ever acted in a film or play?”

00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:47.379
“No, but I have an acting teacher.

00:03:47.379 --> 00:03:51.670
And people think I’m handsome, they really
think I’m beautiful and they think I’m

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.670
talented.”

00:03:52.670 --> 00:04:07.349
What do you say to that?

00:04:07.349 --> 00:04:13.260
God knows I wish you luck but you’re coming
out here with nothing.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:17.440
Do you want me to just drive you to meet my
agent?

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:22.900
It doesn’t work that way.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:32.240
Then there are kids that have pictures, resumes,
decks if they have a project, they have decks

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:39.250
for their project, pictures, actors attached,
they’ve done the research for the demographic

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:45.370
of what they’re trying to sell to, return
on their investment, how much money it…now

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:48.870
when I see that I’m like “Whoah!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:56.720
C’mere let’s talk because you’re serious.”

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.580
I can teach you but you don’t need that
much teaching.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:02.729
All you need is opportunity, see that’s
a different experience.

00:05:02.729 --> 00:05:09.419
If you’re just looking for “I want to
meet your agent.”

00:05:09.419 --> 00:05:15.430
I don’t want to be mean but I just can’t
do that.

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.620
The Agent says to me “Why’d you bring
that person here?”

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.050
“They wanted to meet you.”

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:26.129
That’s not good.

